sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Tester as QA / Test Runner
    participant Spec as API Spec File
    participant Data as Test Data / DTOs
    participant Service as API Service Class
    participant Endpoint as Endpoint Constants
    participant APIUtils as Core API Utilities
    participant API as Unsplash Public API
    participant Assert as Playwright Assertions

    Tester->>Spec: Run API test
    Spec->>Data: Load account, token, request data
    Spec->>Service: Call reusable service method
    Service->>Endpoint: Resolve endpoint path
    Service->>APIUtils: Send HTTP request
    APIUtils->>API: GET / PUT / POST request
    API-->>APIUtils: HTTP response
    APIUtils-->>Service: APIResponse
    Service-->>Spec: Response object
    Spec->>Assert: Validate status, schema, headers, and body
    Assert-->>Tester: Pass / fail result
